      "capability_id": "capability-bfc8deb63f893fd0e82050292732064ce2f81f841ca02f55fa25dcb6ea8fff95",
      "summary": "固定阈值；业务阈值须由用户确认；未指定值只是候选假设。",
      "conditions_status": "evidenced",
      "knowledge_status": "source_checked"
    },
    {
      "id": "chunk-5c597877c1f103ce268081bc4dce46457181649b908badbd1ce59127fc71e145",
      "end_line": 125,
      "sha256": "sha256:a516236b2c33965611b11c814782ac95875a25accef1fe2ad6ec20a3b1c1a198",
      "source_id": "source-f9ecd6c870725d5a628ae2e8616c7cdf45a7963bd75186a057df1f184adbbabc",
      "start_line": 125,
      "text": "\"algorithm_spec\": \"训练有效值均值为固定baseline，scale=max(1e-9,训练总体标准差)。reset令smooth=baseline,count=0。可用当前值x先更新smooth=alpha*x+(1-alpha)*smooth，只有original_present=True才count+=1。count<min_history时insufficient_history，score=None,evidence={}。否则upper=(smooth-baseline)/scale，lower取反，two_sided取绝对值；evidence含ewma、baseline、scale。value=None时missing_input、score=None、evidence={}，不更新平滑值或计数。fit不得留下角色滚动状态，save/load必须保留全部配置和统计量。\"",
      "source": "capabilities/ewma/capability.json",
      "source_sha256": "sha256:34742af2d68e6df5600ee2547d4b0556cb1dff020e7c0fc895587dc4d8a12617",
      "capability_id": "capability-6c5773d4f7d2ac25dd1eea67e3d1472c25adb240b3d7151b3a43569c851ba666",
      "summary": "EWMA；适于持续变化；固定训练基线保留长期偏移，较小alpha会降低响应速度。",
      "conditions_status": "evidenced",
      "knowledge_status": "source_checked"
    },
    {
      "id": "chunk-0d878bf874bd6951417f6908a83ef749e38a361c7c3f2dd300f9151465c83c73",
      "end_line": 126,
      "sha256": "sha256:1b58e64f03a51f0b9db13073b8a8dfcb09e76f008517b5decd76e3b2f3b8478d",
      "source_id": "source-d90cd59af292b2d3963ea0f8b904f5f54511065a47470e3672b71af3f2e38583",
      "start_line": 126,
      "text": "\"algorithm_spec\": \"仅使用当前点前最近window时间槽（包含None槽）；只有original_present=True的历史点计min_history。可用插补值参与median/MAD，但不计真实历史数。value=None时missing_input；真实历史不足时insufficient_history。m=median(有效历史)，mad=median(abs(v-m))，s=max(1.4826*mad,scale_floor)。upper=(x-m)/s，lower=(m-x)/s，two_sided=abs(x-m)/s。evidence含median,mad,scale。训练有效原始值R7分位数（位置(n-1)*q线性插值）的IQR确定scale_floor=max(1e-9,IQR*1e-6)。先评分，再把当前点追加到历史，包括异常点、插补和不可用None槽，保留最近window槽。min_history不得超过window。fit不能把训练点留作角色历史。\"",
      "source": "capabilities/rolling_mad/capability.json",
      "source_sha256": "sha256:39d8d9a00953b367af3f105a356912956a920f26dcc44796dec0346b3b88fb66",
      "capability_id": "capability-b4fb70d5b0d9351ba494f89462d2befb09fc808853abd75784daaf3c85ef8a3d",
      "summary": "滚动 MAD；自适应历史窗口可能把持续变化吸收为新基线。",
      "conditions_status": "evidenced",
      "knowledge_status": "source_checked"
    },
